145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (The Catafjord Nordest 63 embodies the timeless elegance of long-range cruising catamarans. This vessel is designed to venture offshore and redefine the meaning of freedom at sea. Built to the plans of Lock Crowther, she combines powerful ocean-going lines with a refined, understated style, resulting in a silhouette that is fluid, balanced, and resolutely blue-water oriented.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (On board, every space is filled with light and openness. The spacious covered cockpit serves as a true outdoor saloon. It's protected, inviting, and ideal for sharing meaningful moments at sea. Inside, the saloon blends warm wood finishes, generous volumes, and the comfort expected from a yacht designed for extended passages. Six cabins accommodate family and guests with privacy, tranquility, and smooth sailing comfort.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
147 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (Constructed in epoxy-laminated strip-planked red cedar, the Catafjord offers remarkable structural rigidity and a rare sense of solidity, while preserving the natural elegance typical of exceptional offshore yachts. Under sail, her ketch rig provides outstanding balance, ensuring smooth, efficient, and secure performance in both light breezes and stronger conditions.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (Powered by two recent, well-maintained engines, she delivers generous autonomy, further enhanced by a comprehensive energy system. Its ideal for extended cruising in comfort and independence. Every detail, from the protected central helm station to the interior saloon with bar and onboard amenities, reflects a commitment to offering an authentic, serene, and high-end sailing experience.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (More than a yacht, the Catafjord represents a way of life, a space of freedom where time slows down, the sea becomes intimate, and every crossing turns into a lasting memory. A catamaran for those who wish to travel differently, with elegance, soul, and the rare feeling of being exactly where they belong, somewhere offshore.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
